# The build context of docker/Dockerfile and docker/backup.Dockerfile is the repository root.

# Secrets and private data never enter an image: env files, the directory spreadsheet (driver phone numbers),
# case exports, keys and tool configs. The containers get their environment from /opt/arham/.env at run time.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/ambulances-clinics*
**/*.csv
**/*.xlsx
**/*.cases-export.*
**/arham-private
**/.codex
**/.mcp.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets
**/private

# Not needed to build or run: dependencies and the Next.js build are made inside the image; tests, evals and docs
# are not part of it.
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
.next
coverage
graphify-out
docs
tests
evals
**/*.md
**/*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
vitest.config.ts
**/.DS_Store
